    <section class="page__content" itemprop="text">
      <h2 id="welcome">Welcome!</h2>

<p>The 32nd International Conference on Computational Linguistics (COLING 2027) will take place in <strong>Macau, China</strong> from <strong>May 9th to 14th, 2027</strong>.</p>

<h2 id="news">News</h2>

<!--**Website is under construction. Stay tuned for updates!**
{: .text-center .notice--info}-->

<style>
.news-table { font-size: .9em; table-layout: fixed; }
.news-table tr td:nth-child(1) { font-weight: bold; width: 12em; white-space: nowrap; }
.news-table a { color: #d40000; font-weight: bold; }
</style>

<table class="news-table">
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td>October 30, 2026</td>
      <td><a href="/calls/system_demonstrations/">Call for System Demonstrations</a> is posted.</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<table class="news-table">
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td>October 9, 2026</td>
      <td><strong>Submissions closing soon!</strong> Deadline is October 12, 11:59pm AOE. Portal: <a href="https://openreview.net/group?id=aclweb.org/ACL/ARR/2026/October">OpenReview</a></td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<table class="news-table">
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td>September 17, 2026</td>
      <td><a href="/calls/industry_track/">Call for Industry Track Papers</a> is posted.</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<table class="news-table">
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td>September 10, 2026</td>
      <td><a href="/calls/tutorials/">Call for Tutorial Proposals</a> is posted.</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<table class="news-table">
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td>July 29, 2026</td>
      <td><a href="/calls/main_conference_papers/">Call for Main Conference Papers</a> is posted.</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<table class="news-table">
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td>July 28, 2026</td>
      <td><a href="/calls/workshop_proposals/">Call for Workshop Proposals</a> is posted.</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2 id="important-dates">Important Dates</h2>

<table class="dates-table">
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td>ARR submission deadline</td>
      <td>Monday</td>
      <td>October 12, 2026</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Commitment after meta-reviews</td>
      <td>Wednesday</td>
      <td>December 23, 2026</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Notification of acceptance</td>
      <td>Wednesday</td>
      <td>February 10, 2027</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Virtual Conference</td>
      <td>Thursday - Friday</td>
      <td>May 6-7, 2027</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Main Conference</td>
      <td>Sunday - Friday</td>
      <td>May 9–14, 2027</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<style>
.dates-table { font-size: .9em; }
.dates-table tr td:nth-child(1) { width: 55%; }
.dates-table tr td:nth-child(2) { width: 25%; }
.dates-table del { color: #888; }
</style>

<p><b>All deadlines are 11.59 pm <a target="_blank" href="https://www.timeanddate.com/time/zone/timezone/utc-12">UTC -12h</a> (anywhere on earth).</b></p>

